	    .Q(out),
	    .D(in),
	    .SM(scanen),
	    .SI(sin),
	    .CK(clock)
	);

endmodule
```

Your task is to complete the implementation of the flip-flop by adding the necessary logic for the asynchronous reset feature. The reset input should be active-low and should reset the flip-flop to 0 when asserted. Assume that the reset input is not affected by the scan enable feature.

